    "securityReviewStatus": "pending"
  },
  "prototypeNotes": [
    "Draft initialization creates structure and source-supported base values only.",
    "Race, Auspice, and Tribe dependent values remain unset until their explicit selection operations run.",
    "Cliath Rank 1 is initialized immediately because the source supports it as the standard starting rank.",
    "The operation is deterministic and performs no Narrative Intelligence or external provider call.",
    "Chronicle owns identity allocation, transactions, persistence, idempotency, and events.",
    "The Rule Set owns field structure, initial mechanical values, and validation."
  ]
}
